        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    unit_contribution_margin = 20\n    fixed_production_costs = 500000\n    maximum_production_units = 300000\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    contribution_margin = maximum_production_units * unit_contribution_margin\n    dol = contribution_margin / (contribution_margin - fixed_production_costs)\n\n    # DOL decreases as production increases, so it is least at the maximum level\n    answer = float(maximum_production_units)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
